ind them  he's been cast as holt barrier a former  circus star who's been hired to look  after Dumbo both story begins after  returning home from World War one the  war has made him an amputee so going  back to his old job is simply out of the  question  Holt and his children become Dumbo's  number one pals and before long he  becomes part of their family  Ava green as Colette merchant for now  little is known about Ava Green's  character Colette however we do know  that she's a famous aerial artist who  loves being in the spotlight Colette and  Dumbo eventually become co-stars in an  act but we'll have to wait and find out  which side Colette is really on eva is  well known for playing miss Peregrine's  in the hit movie Miss Pentagon's Home  for peculiar children so we're excited  to see what the acclaimed actress has in  store for us now Danny DeVito as max  Medici is there anyone on this earth who  doesn't know who Danny DeVito is we  highly doubt it  this oscar-winning actor is set to play  circus owner max Medici this character  is quick to make an extra buck and he  doesn't care who you hurts to earn it  Max's persona is loosely based off of  the nameless ringmaster from the  original Dumbo movie and in the  live-action remake we'll see how far max  is willing to go to save his struggling  circus business for the time being this  character has been labeled as a bad guy  Michael Keaton as VA Xander fear every  movie needs an antagonist and in this  case it's none other than the renowned  actor Michael Keaton he's set to play  the conniving VA VanDerveer a famous  recruiter who'll stop at nothing to own  the latest attraction from what we've  seen so far it looks like van Devere has  his sights set on poor Dumbo and there's  no way of knowing his evil tactics will  prevail a sequel vibe elephants are  beautiful and intelligent animals who  don't deserve to be bred into captivity  however mini circuses see fit to keep  them around back in 1941 it was normal  for 