e revenue  okay well maybe it has a little to do  with that but for the most part Disney  wants to bring back Dumbo's classic  message which is to believe in yourself  despite what others think  Dumbo story is definitely a tearjerker  which is why it's often compared to  Bambi however there is something special  about the storyline and it has  everything to do with a little black  feather in the original film Dumbo and  Timothy wake up in a tree after a night  of good fun and their confusion makes a  murder of crows laugh out loud  despite not having any memories of the  night before Dumbo is certain that he  must have blown up the tree so when a  Crow's feather floats down to him he  holds it out as a beacon of hope flash  forward to the remake and the scene  black feather teaches Dumbo how to fly  despite the fact that the black feather  came from a crow who was mocking him  Dumbo used it as fuel to achieve his  dreams so in a way this black feather is  very symbolic  although the newest Dumbo film might  still succeed at making us shed a tear  or two it also teaches us to turn our  weaknesses into strengths  so are you guys excited to watch this  live-action remake let us know how you  feel about it in the comments section  below and that's the end of our video  thanks for watching and see you next  time on the theme  [Music]

